   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「任せてください！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:224300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「一世一代の舞台なんですから、ここは大胆に行きましょうよ！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:224400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「アレですよ、ア・レ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:224500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「花嫁と花婿の写真を撮るんですもん。当然でしょ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:224600",
   "type": "dialogue",
