   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「んふ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:225400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「幸せにしてくださいね。宮代先輩」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:225500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ほら、みんな祝福してくれてますよ♪」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:225600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ありがとうございます。あたし、拓留さんと幸せになります！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:225700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「えへへえ。じつはー」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:225800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あたしと、拓留さんの、愛の結晶に導かれたから、かな？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:225900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「えー。恥ずかしいよお」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「えっとお」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「赤ちゃんが出来たんです」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「来月生まれるんです」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「んふふふ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「拓留さんってほんとそういうのが好きでー」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ほぼ毎日なんです。ストレスたまってる時は特に激しくて……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「でも、拓留さんの体温を感じると愛されてるって思えるから、あたしも受け入れちゃうんですよね」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「休み時間でも『口唇欲求が募った』とか言いだして、校舎裏に連れて行かれるんです」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「しょうがないから、そこで満足するまで舐めさせてあげたりして……。ほんと、子犬みたいでかわいいんです」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:226900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「この前なんか部活の最中にＲＩＮＥでお願いされちゃって」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「仕方ないからみんなに見えないようにカーテンで隠して、ええと、あの……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「その、口で……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「はい。あたしも気持ちいいの大好きですから♪」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「お姉さん！ ありがとうございます！ 拓留さんと、この子と３人で、絶対に幸せな家庭を築きますから！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「えええ！？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「責任とってくれるって言ったじゃないですか！ あれはその場限りの嘘だったんですか！？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そんな！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「最初からあたしの身体だけが目的だったんですね！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「自分の性欲を満たしたいがためだけに、純真な乙女の気持ちを弄んだんですね！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:227900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ひどい、酷すぎます！ いえ、あたしのことはどうでもいいんです」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:228000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「この、生まれてくる子供が可哀想です。こんな無責任なお父さんだったなんて……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:228100",
   "type": "dialogue",
